span class=\"font-bold text-positive\">✓</span></td><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5 \"><span class=\"font-bold text-muted\">✗</span></td><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5 \"><span class=\"font-bold text-muted\">✗</span></td><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5 \"><span class=\"font-bold text-muted\">✗</span></td><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5 \"><span class=\"font-bold text-muted\">✗</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-[14px] text-muted\">The honest answer: other tools <em>add to</em> your stack. Pyngyn <em>replaces</em> it.</p></section><section class=\"wrap py-[40px]\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Simple pricing</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 max-w-[820px] font-display text-[clamp(24px,3vw,34px)] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em]\">One price. Everything included. Cancel anytime.</h2><div class=\"mt-7 grid gap-[22px] lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_1fr]\"><div class=\"rounded-[22px] border border-accent bg-white p-7 shadow-soft ring-1 ring-accent\"><div class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent\">Professional services plan</div><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-baseline gap-2\"><span class=\"font-display text-[44px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.02em]\">$9</span><span class=\"text-[14px] text-muted\">per seat / month</span></div><div class=\"mt-1 text-[13.5px] text-muted\">Workspace · pair with Client Space ($19/client) or bundle for $24.99/mo</div><ul class=\"mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-2.5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px] text-ink\"><span class=\"mt-1 text-positive\">✓</span>Knowledge management + SOPs</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px] text-ink\"><span class=\"mt-1 text-positive\">✓</span>AI trained on your firm</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px] text-ink\"><span class=\"mt-1 text-positive\">✓</span>Projects, finances &amp; billable timesheets</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px] text-ink\"><span class=\"mt-1 text-positive\">✓</span>Unlimited client workspaces</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px] text-ink\"><span class=\"mt-1 text-positive\">✓</span>Onboarding &amp; setup support</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px] text-ink\"><span class=\"mt-1 text-positive\">✓</span>Cancel anytime · no lock-in</li></ul><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/demo/\">Book a demo →</a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Start 30-day free trial</a></div></div><div class=\"card\"><h3 class=\"text-[16px] font-bold\">The ROI for your firm</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">20 consultants × 35% time saved × $150/hr billing =<!-- --> <strong class=\"text-ink\">$210K/year</strong> in recoverable value. PYNGYN pays for itself in the first month.</p><h4 class=\"mt-6 text-[14px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-muted\">Start with a 30-day free trial</h4><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">No credit card. No commitment. Set up in under an hour. If it doesn&#x27;t save your team time in 30 days, walk away.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"wrap py-[40px]\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">How it works</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 max-w-[820px] font-display text-[clamp(24px,3vw,34px)] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em]\">Up and running in under a week.</h2><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-[18px] sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"card h-full\"><div class=\"text-[22px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\">📞</div><div class=\"mt-3 text-[11.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent\">Day 1</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-[16.5px] font-bold text-ink\">Setup call</div><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">We set up your workspace together. Import your existing SOPs, connect your team. Takes 60 minutes.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><div class=\"text-[22px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\">👥</div><div class=\"mt-3 text-[11.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent\">Day 2–3</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-[16.5px] font-bold text-ink\">Team onboarding</div><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Your team logs in. No training required, the interface is intuitive from day one. We stay on standby.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><div class=\"text-[22px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⚡</div><div class=\"mt-3 text-[11.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent\">Day 4–7</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-[16.5px] font-bold text-ink\">First workflows live</div><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Your first client engagement runs through Pyngyn. Tasks assigned, SOPs active, AI learning your context.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><div class=\"text-[22px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</div><div class=\"mt-3 text-[11.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent\">Day 30</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-[16.5px] font-bold text-ink\">Review &amp; decide</div><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">We review what time was saved, what got easier. If you&#x27;re happy, you pay. If not, you walk away. No hard sell.</p></div></div><p class=\"mt-5 text-[14px] text-muted\">We handle the entire setup. You focus on client work. Our goal: you feel value in week 1, not month 3.</p></section><section class=\"wrap py-[40px]\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Questions we always get</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-display text-[26px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\">Let&#x27;s address them directly.</h2><div class=\"mt-7 grid gap-[18px] md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[16.5px] font-bold leading-snug\">“<!-- -->We already use Notion / ClickUp.<!-- -->”</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Those tools store documents or manage tasks. Pyngyn connects both to your AI and makes SOPs active in workflow. You&#x27;d still be using 3–4 other tools. Pyngyn replaces all of them.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[16.5px] font-bold leading-snug\">“<!-- -->My team won&#x27;t adopt another tool.<!-- -->”</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">We hear this every time. Pyngyn is designed for day-one productivity, no training sessions, no thick documentation. Hand it to a new hire and they&#x27;re productive within the hour.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[16.5px] font-bold leading-snug\">“<!-- -->Is our data safe?<!-- -->”</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Your firm&#x27;s data is encrypted, stored securely, and never used to train general AI models. Your knowledge stays yours, it only makes your Pyngyn smarter.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[16.5px] font-bold leading-snug\">“<!-- -->Does PYNGYN pay for itself?<!-- -->”</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">20 consultants × 35% time saved = significant recoverable hours every week. PYNGYN pays for itself well within the first month for most firms.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"wrap py-[40px]\"><div class=\"rounded-[24px] border border-line bg-[#0b0d12] p-8 text-white shadow-art md:p-12\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dark\">Ready to stop juggling tools?</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 max-w-[760px] font-display text-[clamp(26px,3.6vw,42px)] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em]\">One conversation. One demo. 30 days free.<!-- --> <span class=\"text-accent\">No commitment.</span></h2><ol class=\"mt-8 grid gap-[18px] md:grid-cols-3\"><li class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-5\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[12px] font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] text-accent\">01</div><div class=\"mt-2 text-[15.5px] font-bold\">Book a 30-min demo</div><div class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/70\">See Pyngyn running on a real PS firm workflow. We show you exactly how it replaces your current stack.</div></li><li class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-5\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[12px] font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] text-accent\">02</div><div class=\"mt-2 text-[15.5px] font-bold\">Start your free trial</div><div class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/70\">We set up your workspace in 60 minutes. Your team is live by end of day. No credit card needed.</div></li><li class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-5\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[12px] font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] text-accent\">03</div><div class=\"mt-2 text-[15.5px] font-bold\">Pay only if you love it</div><div class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/70\">At day 30 we review together. If Pyngyn isn&#x27;t saving your team time, you walk away. Simple.</div></li></ol><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3.5\"><a class=\"btn bg-white text-ink hover:bg-white/90\" href=\"/demo/\">Book a demo</a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"btn border border-white/15 bg-white/5 text-white hover:bg-white/10\">Start free trial</a></div><div class=\"mt-8 text-[13px] text-white/55\"><strong class=\"text-white/80\">Scale simply, work happily.</strong> · 15–30 person PS &amp; consulting firms · Vivek Pandey, Founder &amp; CEO ·<!-- --> <a class=\"hover:text-white\" href=\"mailto:vivek.pandey@pyngyn.com\">vivek.pandey@pyngyn.com</a></div></div></section><section id=\"demo\" class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white px-7 py-[72px] text-center shadow-card\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 left-1/2 h-[420px] w-[420px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-accent-lt opacity-70 blur-[80px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"eyebrow relative\">Ready when you are</span><h2 class=\"title relative mx-auto mt-3.5 max-w-[680px] text-[clamp(30px,4.4vw,48px)]\">Stop managing the tool. Start shipping the work.</h2><p class=\"lead relative mx-auto mt-[18px]\">See PYNGYN run a real project in 30 minutes, and let AI handle the project management busywork.</p><div class=\"relative m